title: MrSnowman
---
Mr. Snowman: ...
Mr. Snowman: .....
Mr. Snowman: Hello! I'm Mr. Snowman!
Mr. Snowman: .....
Mr. Snowman: I haven't had the pleasure of speaking to someone in years!
Mr. Snowman: I must inquire with you...
Mr. Snowman: Is it a little warm in here or is that just me?
-> Now that you mention it...
    Mr. Snowman: I fear for my safety, friend.
    Mr. Snowman: For each year is warmer than the last.
    Mr. Snowman: How many more will pass 'till I am simply a puddle on this mountain?
-> Nah I don't think so
    Mr. Snowman: Ah, apologies.
